secubox-toolbox-ng (0.1.18-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * sbxmitm CSP: make the INLINE transparency banner actually run on nonce-based
    CSP sites (YouTube, most news sites). The banner is inlined (service-worker-
    proof), but a CSP nonce/hash makes 'unsafe-inline' IGNORED, so the bare inline
    script was silently blocked — banner never appeared. Now we BORROW the page's
    own nonce and stamp it on the injected <script nonce=…> (surgical: the page's
    CSP/nonces/hashes stay intact), falling back to forcing 'unsafe-inline'
    (dropping nonce/hash/strict-dynamic) only when there is no nonce to borrow.
    Nonce values are validated (base64 charset) to prevent attribute breakout.
    (#728 youtube/news bannering)

